  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception as a single automaton, with helper states for action commits and obstacle recovery. The specification binds sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforcing conservative recovery and rapid return to exploration. Only one controllable is enabled per non-perception state, and all uncontrollable events are handled in every state. Full_rotate is used only as a last-resort after repeated blockages.",
